<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<manual xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="manual.xsd" status="draft">
  <title>Hydraulic Lift Operator Manual</title>
  <chapter id="intro">
    <title>Introduction</title>
    <para>This manual describes the <b>safe operation</b> of the lift. Read <xref linkend="safety">Safety</xref> before use.</para>
    <para>Torque values are given in N·m; pressure in bar (10<sup>5</sup> Pa).</para>
    <list type="numbered">
      <item><para>Inspect the hydraulic lines.</para></item>
      <item><para>Check the fluid level.</para></item>
      <item><para><?xm-replace_text Type the next step?></para></item>
    </list>
    <!-- Reviewer: confirm torque values with engineering. -->
  </chapter>
  <chapter id="safety">
    <title>Safety</title>
    <warning><para>Never stand under a raised load.</para></warning>
    <table>
      <title>Inspection intervals</title>
      <tgroup cols="3">
        <colspec colname="c1" colwidth="2*"/><colspec colname="c2" colwidth="1*"/><colspec colname="c3" colwidth="1*"/>
        <thead><row><entry>Item</entry><entry>Interval</entry><entry>Action</entry></row></thead>
        <tbody>
          <row><entry>Hydraulic hoses</entry><entry>Daily</entry><entry>Inspect</entry></row>
          <row><entry>Pump seals</entry><entry>Monthly</entry><entry><i>Replace if worn</i></entry></row>
          <row><entry morerows="1">Lift arms</entry><entry>Weekly</entry><entry>Lubricate</entry></row>
          <row><entry colname="c2">Yearly</entry><entry colname="c3">Replace pivot pins</entry></row>
          <row><entry namest="c1" nameend="c3">Record every inspection in the maintenance log.</entry></row>
        </tbody>
      </tgroup>
    </table>
    <section id="s1">
      <title>Emergency stop</title>
      <para>Press the red button. The controller logs the event:</para>
      <code>EVENT 17: E-STOP
  latched = true</code>
    </section>
  </chapter>
</manual>
